							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">One solid piece of evidence that Mumia&#039;s detractors sleep on and ofetn try to cover up was that the bullets found in Officer Faulkner&#039;s body DO NOT fit the caliber of gun found in Mumia&#039;s taxi; they are bigger in diameter.</td>
