							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php#1">MASS LINE FORUMS</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?board=2.0">The Dialogue</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=677.msg9613#msg9613">dRED.i featured on Davey D.com</a>
